//  Integers
// - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

// For version 1.x we don't support the complete 64 bit integer range.
// We reserve one value from the top positive range and 2 values from
// the bottom negative range to represent +/- Inf and NULL.

